    <tags>aktar upload s3 cloudflare-r2 backblaze-b2 minio screenshot file-sharing sharex-alternative foss</tags>
    <summary>Upload files, screenshots and the clipboard to your own S3, Cloudflare R2 or Backblaze B2 bucket and get a link.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Aktar uploads files, screenshots and the clipboard to **your own** storage: Amazon S3, Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2, DigitalOcean Spaces, MinIO or any S3-compatible service. The link is on your clipboard a moment later.

- Drop files on the tray icon or the panel, or use the global shortcut for the clipboard.
- Capture a screenshot with Snipping Tool, ShareX or Flameshot, and upload what you annotate.
- Watched folders, short links, QR codes, expiring uploads, image processing (WebP, AVIF, resize), share pages and file requests.
- Upload history with thumbnails and a bucket browser.
- No servers, no accounts, no tracking: files go straight from your PC to your bucket, and keys stay in Windows Credential Manager.

Aktar is free and open source, with apps for macOS, Linux, iPhone and Android too.

## Package notes

The package runs Aktar's own installer, which installs per user into `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Aktar` for the user running Chocolatey, and keeps itself up to date.
]]></description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
